/public/assets/sunscar-dunes/
/public/assets/driftwood-isle/

.tsc-layers/

# Pin outputs: `pins.ts install` publishes each pinned shardfile's program mount here (mounts/programs/<slug>.json). The
# canonical checkout's info/exclude lists the files it once wrote; a new pin's file showed up untracked in worktrees and
# the pre-push refused it (2026-11-11). Pure build output, never committed.
/public/programs/

# Pin outputs under public/assets/ (opus-pinignore, 2026-11-11). `pins.ts install` publishes each pinned shardfile's
# asset mounts here, and only the canonical checkout's info/exclude lists them. A worktree made after a re-pin held the
# new files untracked (Nalati's content-hashed astc6/ variants), so `worktree.mjs reap` kept it: `git worktree remove`
# refuses untracked files. Directories only, each holding pin output and no tracked file, so a re-pin's new hashes stay
# covered. A pin file beside tracked files (hdri/, models/hatchet/, music/folk/ ...) is left to info/exclude.
# test/tooling/pins-ignore.test.mjs guards both halves: these paths ignored, no tracked public/ file matched.
/public/assets/*/astc6/
/public/assets/far-reach/
/public/assets/nalati/
/public/assets/pine-hollow/
